note bottom of StaffAuditLogController
  GET /api/v1/laboratories/{laboratoryId}/staff/{staffId}/audit-logs
  Operations registered with the account of the staff member, newest first
  (quality managers, administrators and auditors).
end note
note bottom of EquipmentAuditLogController
  GET /api/v1/batches/{batchId}/audit-logs (TS80)
  GET /api/v1/laboratories/{laboratoryId}/equipments/{equipmentId}/audit-logs
  Entries are recorded by the platform; there is no POST.
end note
note bottom of InventoryAuditEventHandler
  RawMaterialSaved and InventoryMovementRecorded (RECEIPT, REVIEW) of Inventory;
  consumptions are audited as raw material usages of the batch.
end note

